{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Drop. Merge. Win.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claw Dropper is an satisfying arcade style 'Drop and Merge' game. Move the claw and drop pieces to combine matching objects into bigger and bigger creations until you win! Different characters bring <strong>unique abilities</strong> that add a fresh twist to every challenge. Enjoy three different arcade modes: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 Classic Mode</strong>:\u00a0Relax and enjoy the original drop &amp; merge challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 Time Trial</strong>:\u00a0Race the clock, beat your best time, and climb the rankings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 Survival</strong>:\u00a0Keep the board clear as long as possible as the speed ramps up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939810/extras/a3b9667e7216cff30ef049f13b62372d.avif?t=1757347856\" width=1454 height=501 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy playing around in Sandbox mode with many custom modifiers to choose from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939810/extras/eb193f099111936014c2d22e041ee0ac.avif?t=1757347856\" width=374 height=352 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3939810?t=1757347856","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3939810?t=1757347856","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939810/b848ff8686b35ffdb40735abfd0366665993bf1d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757347856","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_